Package: libfontconfig1
Version: @DEB_FONTCONFIG_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Depends: libfreetype6, firmware (>= 14.0) | libexpat1, fontconfig-config
Section: Libraries
Priority: standard
Description: generic font configuration library - runtime (Ladybird pin 2.17.1)
 Fontconfig is a font configuration and customization library, which does not
 depend on the X Window System. It locates fonts and selects them according to
 application requirements.
 .
 This package contains the runtime library. Built --disable-nls with the
 system expat; the legacy libuuid dependency is gone in 2.17.
